  "prefLabel": "Plc 801.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 801.02 Applicability. This chapter shall apply to any individual who intends to practice or who does actually practice ophthalmic dispensing in New Hampshire, exclusive of those persons and practices excluded by RSA 327-A:13, reprinted in Appendix B.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 800) #13885 eff 4-15-24",
